# ReplayFix2: Mario's mirror actor (マリオin鏡) on replay frames, bianco/0 at fps 60 (pre-written
# build/Route/<name>/appdata/Sunshine/settings.ini: [video] fps_limit=60).
# Env: SUNSHINE_DEV_START=bianco/0 SUNSHINE_DEV_SKIP_MOVIES=1 SUNSHINE_DEV_SEED=1.
# Idle (idle animation still moves the joints), then walks towards the lake, so the source matrices change every tick.
# Evidence: run.log [framerate] window presents N/s; temporary mirror-matrix log lines; m_*.png.
waitfor director mario dirstate=4 camDemo=0 timeout=3000
wait frames=90
cheat infinite_health
log
wait frames=300
shot m_idle.png
hold stick=0,127 frames=120
log
shot m_walk_a.png
hold stick=-127,0 frames=90
hold stick=0,127 frames=120
log
shot m_walk_b.png
wait frames=150
hold stick=127,0 frames=90
hold stick=0,-127 frames=120
log
shot m_walk_c.png
wait frames=300
log
end
